  "result": "```json\n{\n  \"smpl.ordering.repositories.CatalogItemsRepository\": {\n    \"summary\": \"Repository interface for managing catalog item data. Provides CRUD operations for catalog items including: (1) getCatalogItems() - retrieves all catalog items; (2) getCatalogItem(String sku) - retrieves a specific catalog item by SKU (Stock Keeping Unit); (3) upsertCatalogItem(String sku, CatalogItem catalogItem, String eTag) - inserts or updates a catalog item with optimistic concurrency control via eTag, returns true if successful; (4) removeCatalogItem(String sku, String eTag) - removes a catalog item by SKU with eTag-based concurrency control, returns true if successful. The interface uses eTag parameters in modification operations to support optimistic concurrency control and prevent conflicting updates.\",\n    \"file_path\": \"smpl/ordering/repositories/CatalogItemsRepository.java\"\n  }\n}\n```",
